# Number of internal batch transcription lanes (k = 1..N). Each lane gets its own virtual mic
# (virtmic{k}), Chromium instance (CDP 9223+k), logged-in profile clone, and a tiled window on :95.
# Lane 0 (the live streaming frontend) is separate and always reserved.
# Read by: setup-virtmic.sh, setup-lanes.sh, wispr-lane.sh, install.sh, and the server (WISPR_LANES).
WISPR_LANES=7
